# The Wishing Potion (Q334), the potion's road: a level 30 character accepts at Matild, takes the
# secret book from the tree keeper, trades it and the text for the two recipes, then gathers the
# eight ingredients (every drop roll 0) and trades them for the wish potion and Matild's orb.
# Matild's pages follow each stage; with the potion in hand she shows the wish pages 13 and 15
# and gives the recipes again. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q334_the_wishing_potion.golden
character Seeker 30
random always 0
script quest.Q334_TheWishingPotion
item 57 3467 3678 3679 3680 3681 3682 3683 3684 3685 3686 3687 3688 3689 3690 3691
page default/30738.htm
page script/quest/Q334_TheWishingPotion/
npc matild 30738 Folk 10 0 0
npc tree 27139 Monster 0 40 0
npc wind 20078 Monster 0 -40 0
npc ant 20087 Monster 40 40 0
npc silenos 20168 Monster 40 -40 0
npc tyrant 20192 Monster -40 40 0
npc basilisk 20199 Monster -40 -40 0
npc horror 20227 Monster 80 0 0
npc bugbear 20248 Monster -80 0 0
npc jaguar 20250 Monster 0 80 0

# Matild: a level 30 character may take the quest.
action matild
action matild
