  S SystemMessage id=54 3:3678
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=matild item=0 page=script/quest/Q334_TheWishingPotion/30738-04.htm
  S ActionFailed
  Q upsert Q334_TheWishingPotion | <state> | STARTED
  Q upsert Q334_TheWishingPotion | <cond> | 1
  state Q334_TheWishingPotion STARTED
  items 3678=1
relog
